              "text": "Give your name, ask someone else's, say you're pleased. (Enṟe pēru … āṇŭ. / Ninṟe pēru entāṇŭ? / Santōṣam.) What grammatical word does Malayalam have that Tamil, Kannada, and Telugu lack? (A copula — āṇŭ, \"is.\")"
